From ef035ea30a16918a29cabc1078dfe9bfb34ffc85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agentic_apr <xianng.24@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 16:19:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Install libfontconfig-dev, libxml2-dev, gettext,
 autoconf-archive

These were missing, making 15 Defects4C bugs infra-blocked (baseline won't build):
  libgd x5   -> "fontconfig requested but not found"   (libfontconfig-dev)
  php-src x8 -> "xml2-config not found"                (libxml2-dev)
  sniproxy   -> "undefined macro AC_LIB_PREPARE_PREFIX" (gettext m4)
  cjose      -> "undefined macro ..."                   (autoconf-archive)

Verified in the running container: libgd configure now finds fontconfig
(configure rc=0), xml2-config resolves (libxml2 2.9.10).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Dockerfile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
index 7a1b2b8..ebe0c16 100644
--- a/Dockerfile
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -154,6 +154,7 @@ RUN apt-get update -yq && \
       dnsmasq-base dnsmasq-utils qemu-system-x86 qemu-utils libvirt0 libvirt-dev \
       libapparmor-dev libslang2 xterm libatm1 libxtables12 \
       meson graphviz libcpptest-dev yasm libjansson-dev libmagic-dev zlib1g-dev \
+      libfontconfig-dev libxml2-dev gettext autoconf-archive \
     && \
     apt-get autoremove -y && apt-get clean && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
 
-- 
2.43.0

